      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><h3>01</h3><p>Privacy first</p></div>
      <div class="stat"><h3>02</h3><p>Smart protection</p></div>
      <div class="stat"><h3>03</h3><p>Easy controls</p></div>
      <div class="stat"><h3>24/7</h3><p>Security awareness</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="features" id="features">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="heading">
        <span class="tag">POWERFUL FEATURES</span>
        <h2>Security made simple</h2>
        <p>Explore essential features a modern antivirus product can offer.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">???</div>
          <h3>Threat Protection</h3>
          <p>Designed to detect and block malware using a real security engine.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">??</div>
          <h3>Privacy Protection</h3>
          <p>Keep privacy in focus with safer browsing and privacy controls.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">??</div>
          <h3>Web Protection</h3>
          <p>Help identify phishing attempts, unsafe links, and suspicious websites.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">?</div>
          <h3>Lightweight Design</h3>
          <p>Enjoy a clean, simple interface designed around ease of use.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">??</div>
          <h3>File Security</h3>
          <p>Real antivirus software can analyze files using detection technology.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">??</div>
          <h3>Security Reports</h3>
          <p>Present scan results, threat details, and security information clearly.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="scanner">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="heading">
        <span class="tag">INTERACTIVE DEMO</span>
        <h2>Try the security scanner</h2>
        <p>This simulated scanner demonstrates the interface only. It does not inspect your files.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="scanner">
        <div class="scanner-head">
          <h3>ShieldX Security Scan</h3>
          <span class="demo-badge">SIMULATION ONLY</span>
        </div>
        <div class="scan-display">
          <div class="scan-circle" id="scanCircle">?</div>
