      <p style="text-align:center;color:#687087;font-size:12px;margin-top:25px">
        *Illustrative prices only. No subscription or payment service is connected.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="heading">
        <span class="tag">HAVE QUESTIONS?</span>
        <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
        <p>Everything you need to know about this website demo.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            What is ShieldX Antivirus? <span>+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">ShieldX is a sample antivirus landing-page template for demonstrating a security product website.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            Does the scanner find real viruses? <span>+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">No. It only animates a progress bar. It does not scan files, detect malware, or protect your device.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            Does this work on mobile devices? <span>+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">Yes. The page layout adapts to mobile phones, tablets, laptops, and desktop browsers.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            Can customers buy a plan here? <span>+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">Not yet. Real subscriptions require a backend, payment provider, and secure order processing.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            How can I make it a real antivirus product? <span>+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">You need a real security engine, malware detection technology, secure updates, testing, and platform-specific software. A website alone cannot provide antivirus protection.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" id="contact">
