      <div class="cta-box">
        <h2>Your security journey starts here.</h2>
        <p>Build a safer digital experience with ShieldX.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@example.com?subject=ShieldX%20Enquiry">Contact Us ?</a>
      </div>
