</main>

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-about">
        <a href="#home" class="logo"><span class="logo-icon">?</span>Shield<span>X</span></a>
        <p>A modern antivirus website template focused on security awareness, privacy, and user experience.</p>
